  {
    "hotel_id": "860254",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/anho-hotel/hotel/yilan-tw.html",
    "name": "Anho Chew Hotel",
    "detail": "It was awesome. Great customer service. I had no itinerary at Yilan. The frontdesk staff did not hesitate to recommend places of interest to visit. One even drew a map on how to get to a particular place. They cater MacDonald's breakfast for guests. They gave me the wrong burger. I didn't realise that I had pork burger, instead of chicken burger, until I took a bite. I found the patty tasted weird and found out that it was the wrong burger. They immediately called MacDonald's to replace. On the first night that I was there, there were a few earthquake tremors. The customer service were very attentive and assure us that it was normal. Also, being a Singaporean, I have never experienced earthquake, they brief me what to do if there is another tremor. I thought that was very thoughtful of them. I highly recommend this place for solo travellers. The bed is comfortable and there is television in every cubicle. The curtain blocked out the light very well, so that you can sleep even when other travellers are using the common light in the room. One suggestion. The shared bathroom is very clean. However, it would be good if they can improve the ventilation.",
